{"id":"2cf48fe7ac55c2ce08c0eb737ace198a9f05cead","axis":"silent","repo":"styled-components/styled-components","sha":"2cf48fe7ac55c2ce08c0eb737ace198a9f05cead","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".github/workflows/release.yml","lines":["@@ -25,7 +25,7 @@ jobs:","       - name: Checkout Repo","         uses: actions/checkout@v4","       - name: Setup pnpm","-        uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4","+        uses: pnpm/action-setup@v6.1.0"," ","       - name: Setup Node.js","         uses: actions/setup-node@v4","@@ -86,7 +86,7 @@ jobs:","         with:","           fetch-depth: 0","       - name: Setup pnpm","-        uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4","+        uses: pnpm/action-setup@v6.1.0"," ","       - name: Setup Node.js","         uses: actions/setup-node@v4"],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":".github/workflows/test.yml","lines":["@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@ jobs:","     steps:","       - uses: actions/checkout@v4"," ","-      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4","+      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v6.1.0"," ","       - uses: actions/setup-node@v4","         with:","@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@ jobs:","     steps:","       - uses: actions/checkout@v4"," ","-      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4","+      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v6.1.0"," ","       - uses: actions/setup-node@v4","         with:","@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@ jobs:","     steps:","       - uses: actions/checkout@v4"," ","-      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4","+      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v6.1.0"," ","       - uses: actions/setup-node@v4","         with:"],"additions":3,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":".husky/pre-commit","lines":["@@ -1 +1 @@","-pnpm lint-staged","+pnpm lint-staged --no-stash"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":".npmrc","lines":["@@ -1,22 +0,0 @@","-# Use hoisted node_modules for React ecosystem compatibility","-node-linker=hoisted","-","-# Exclude React types from hoisting to allow different versions per workspace","-public-hoist-pattern[]=*","-public-hoist-pattern[]=!@types/react","-public-hoist-pattern[]=!@types/react-dom","-public-hoist-pattern[]=!@types/react-native","-","-# Match yarn's behavior for semver ranges","-save-prefix=\"\"","-","-# Don't fail on peer dependency conflicts (React ecosystem compatibility)","-strict-peer-dependencies=false","-","-# Auto-install peer dependencies for better DX","-auto-install-peers=true","-","-# Require packages to be published for at least 7 days before resolving them","-minimum-version-age=7d","-","-"],"additions":0,"deletions":22,"truncated":false},{"path":"AGENTS.md","lines":["@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@ This file is the repo's only agent instructions file; there is no CLAUDE.md. It"," "," - When a task touches consumer-facing behavior, read the most recent llms.txt at https://styled-components.com/llms.txt for the current consumer-facing feature summary"," - GitHub Issues is the backlog: file a discovered deficiency or deferred work there, never in this file","-- Use pnpm package manager and associated commands","+- Use pnpm package manager and associated commands. `packageManager` in `package.json` pins the version; install settings live in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, never `.npmrc`. Installs link from pnpm's global virtual store, so each git worktree installs in seconds. A package that imports another it does not declare resolves only through `packageExtensions` there; `pnpm check:type-resolution` catches the type-level cases, and `scripts/metro-workspace.cjs` holds the Metro-side resolution for the React Native apps"," - Formatting is Biome (config in `biome.jsonc`), enforced by a lint-staged pre-commit hook; `pnpm format` runs it repo-wide (fine to do). Match the config rather than hand-formatting. Biome has no Markdown or YAML formatter yet, so those files are left alone; keep them tidy by hand. Suppress a formatting decision with `// biome-ignore format: <reason>` (spaced, not hyphenated; the hyphenated spelling is a suppression parse error), never `// prettier-ignore`, which Biome does not honor. The linter is on with a curated rule set plus two GritQL plugins; see the Critical Constraints below and the comments in `biome.jsonc`."," - Use conventional commits: `(feat|fix|chore|refactor|test|docs|style|perf|build|ci): [description]`"," - Default to short commit messages: title only, or title plus one tight sentence","@@ -106,6 +106,7 @@ This file is the repo's only agent instructions file; there is no CLAUDE.md. It"," - `pnpm --filter styled-components type-perf`: Consumer type-check budget, measured against the built `dist` (needs `pnpm build` first). `--against <package root>` measures another copy of the package with the same fixture. See [docs/typescript-performance.md](docs/typescript-performance.md)"," - `pnpm knip`: Dead-code scan (unused files, dependencies, exports); config in `knip.jsonc`. Output is a candidate list, not a delete list"," - `pnpm verify`: The local gate; the steps and their order are in `scripts/verify.mjs`","+- `pnpm check:type-resolution`: Traces TypeScript resolution over the library and sandbox tsconfigs and fails when a package in pnpm's global store imports a type package it does not declare (those types would silently become `any`). Fix with an optional peer under `packageExtensions`, or a reasoned entry in the script's `KNOWN_FALSE_POSITIVES`. Exit 2 means the check saw nothing and is broken"," - Native render perf: use `packages/ios-benchmark` (real Hermes V1 on iOS sim). `react-test-renderer` 19.2 with the RN preset doesn't synchronously invoke function components, and V8 numbers don't predict Hermes, so no in-tree native render bench exists. Algorithm-shape benches (parser, responsive, RSC) run via `bench:web` / `bench:rsc`."," - CPU profiling with Bun, and on-device animation debugging: [docs/profiling.md](docs/profiling.md). Debug channels log one line per event, never host instances or props objects."," "],"additions":2,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"CONTRIBUTING.md","lines":["@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@ These days, we highly recommend trying an AI coding assistant to get instant fee"," "," ### Environment setup"," ","-1. Ensure `pnpm` is installed (https://pnpm.io/installation)","+1. Ensure `pnpm` is installed (https://pnpm.io/installation). The repository pins its pnpm version in `package.json`, and pnpm 11.10 or newer switches to that version automatically, so Corepack isn't needed"," 2. [Fork the repository](https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/quickstart/fork-a-repo), then pull it down to your disk: `git clone git@github.com:YOUR_USERNAME/styled-components.git`"," 3. Hop into the styled-components folder and run `pnpm install`"," 4. Set the base repository as upstream: `git remote add upstream git@github.com:styled-components/styled-components.git` (makes it easier to pull updates to your fork)","@@ -32,7 +32,7 @@ Helpful commands:"," - run unit tests: `pnpm test`"," - check code style: `pnpm format:check` (or `pnpm format` to fix; handled automatically if you have the Biome extension installed in your IDE)"," - run build: `pnpm build`","-- run dev sandbox: `pnpm --filter sandbox dev` (or just `pnpm dev` if you're in that folder)","+- run dev sandbox: `pnpm --filter sandbox dev` (or just `pnpm dev` if you're in that folder). The sandbox uses the built library, so run `pnpm build` after changing library source"," "," ### Making changes"," ","@@ -69,14 +69,11 @@ Here is a quick guide to doing code contributions to the library."," "," ### Security updates"," ","-For transitive dependency CVEs, pin the patched version in root `package.json` under `pnpm.overrides`. Do not add a root-level `dependencies` entry for packages the repo does not import directly.","+For transitive dependency CVEs, pin the patched version in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` under `overrides`. Do not add a root-level `dependencies` entry for packages the repo does not import directly."," ","-```json","-\"pnpm\": {","-  \"overrides\": {","-    \"shell-quote\": \">=1.8.4\"","-  }","-}","+```yaml","+overrides:","+  shell-quote: '>=1.8.4'"," ```"," "," Run `pnpm install`, commit the lockfile, and confirm the vulnerable version is gone. Use `>=` to match existing override entries. No changeset needed. If the package is a direct dependency of a workspace package, bump it there instead."],"additions":6,"deletions":9,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/css-polyfills.md","lines":["@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@ Unsupported on Native (no viable workaround) MUST emit `warnOnce` with a stable"," "," ## rn-web parity rule"," ","-Every polyfill must verify its rn-web output against `node_modules/react-native-web/src/`:","+Every polyfill must verify its rn-web output against react-native-web's source (`packages/native-showcase/node_modules/react-native-web/src/`):"," "," - If the browser ships the feature, the rn-web branch passes the raw CSS through. Don't expand, normalize, or fold what the browser handles."," - Never emit a CSS property the browser doesn't ship yet. Lift the equivalent HTML attribute via SPECIAL_CASE_PROPS instead."],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"knip.jsonc","lines":["@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@","       // referenced by path from workspace babel configs.","       \"entry\": [\"scripts/**/*.ts\", \"babel.config.cjs\", \"babel-preset.cjs\"],","       // Referenced by string from babel-preset.cjs but declared by","-      // packages/styled-components (hoisted node_modules resolution).","+      // packages/styled-components, the workspace that runs the preset.","       \"ignoreDependencies\": [\"@babel/preset-env\"]","     },","     \"packages/benchmarks\": {","@@ -37,11 +37,7 @@","         // Babel engine, resolved by Metro/expo tooling rather than imported.","         \"@babel/core\",","         // Not referenced anywhere in the app; knip infers it from expo config.","-        \"expo-updates\",","-        // metro.config.js resolves it from the workspace root on purpose, to","-        // pin Metro to the CJS build; declaring it here would claim the app","-        // owns a copy it deliberately does not.","-        \"pretty-format\"","+        \"expo-updates\"","       ]","     },","     \"packages/sandbox\": {"],"additions":2,"deletions":6,"truncated":false},{"path":"package.json","lines":["@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@","   \"type\": \"module\",","   \"scripts\": {","     \"build\": \"pnpm --filter styled-components build\",","+    \"check:type-resolution\": \"node scripts/check-type-resolution.mjs packages/styled-components/tsconfig.json packages/styled-components/tsconfig.test-types.json packages/sandbox/tsconfig.json\",","     \"sandbox\": \"pnpm --filter sandbox dev\",","     \"release\": \"pnpm --filter styled-components prepublishOnly && changeset publish\",","     \"postinstall\": \"pnpm --filter styled-components generateErrors\",","@@ -28,7 +29,7 @@","   \"engines\": {","     \"node\": \">= 14\"","   },","-  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@10.0.0\",","+  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@12.11.1\",","   \"devDependencies\": {","     \"@biomejs/biome\": \"2.5.7\",","     \"@changesets/cli\": \"^2.27.7\",","@@ -40,17 +41,5 @@","   },","   \"lint-staged\": {","     \"*\": \"biome check --write --no-errors-on-unmatched\"","-  },","-  \"pnpm\": {","-    \"overrides\": {","-      \"@types/react\": \"19\",","-      \"@types/react-dom\": \"19\",","-      \"react\": \"19.2.3\",","-      \"react-dom\": \"19.2.3\",","-      \"fast-xml-parser\": \">=5.7.0\",","-      \"postcss\": \">=8.5.10\",","-      \"serialize-javascript\": \">=7.0.5\",","-      \"shell-quote\": \">=1.8.4\"","-    }","   }"," }"],"additions":2,"deletions":13,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/ios-benchmark/metro.config.js","lines":["@@ -1,20 +1,28 @@"," const { getDefaultConfig, mergeConfig } = require('@react-native/metro-config');"," const path = require('path');","+const { pinSingletonsToApp, storeWatchFolders } = require('../../scripts/metro-workspace.cjs');"," "," const projectRoot = __dirname;"," const workspaceRoot = path.resolve(projectRoot, '../..');"," "," const defaultConfig = getDefaultConfig(projectRoot);","+const defaultResolveRequest = defaultConfig.resolver.resolveRequest;"," "," const config = {","-  watchFolders: [workspaceRoot],","+  watchFolders: [workspaceRoot, ...storeWatchFolders(projectRoot)],","   resolver: {","-    nodeModulesPaths: [","-      path.resolve(projectRoot, 'node_modules'),","-      path.resolve(workspaceRoot, 'node_modules'),","-    ],","-    disableHierarchicalLookup: true,","-    unstable_enableSymlinks: true,","+    // The RN Babel preset injects `@babel/runtime` helper imports into","+    // third-party code that does not declare the package, so the lookup falls","+    // back to the app, which does.","+    nodeModulesPaths: [path.resolve(projectRoot, 'node_modules')],","+    resolveRequest: pinSingletonsToApp({","+      libraryRoot: path.resolve(workspaceRoot, 'packages/styled-components'),","+      projectRoot,","+      resolveRequest: (context, moduleName, platform) =>","+        defaultResolveRequest","+          ? defaultResolveRequest(context, moduleName, platform)","+          : context.resolveRequest(context, moduleName, platform),","+    }),","   },"," };"," "],"additions":15,"deletions":7,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/native-showcase/metro.config.js","lines":["@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@"," const { getDefaultConfig } = require('expo/metro-config');"," const path = require('path');","+const { pinSingletonsToApp, storeWatchFolders } = require('../../scripts/metro-workspace.cjs');"," "," const projectRoot = __dirname;"," const workspaceRoot = path.resolve(projectRoot, '../..');","@@ -21,50 +22,25 @@ const styledWebBridgeSource = path.resolve(","   'packages/styled-components/src/native/web-bridge/index.tsx'"," );"," ","-// pretty-format v30 ships an ESM shim whose last line is","-// `export default cjsModule.default.default`, which assumes the importer","-// wrapped the CJS module in a `{ default: … }` envelope. Metro's interop","-// returns the module untouched when it already carries `__esModule`, so","-// `cjsModule.default` is the pretty-format function and `.default` on it","-// is undefined. That leaves the module's own `default` export undefined,","-// and React Native's HMR client dereferences it at startup, so the app","-// dies with \"Cannot read property 'default' of undefined\" before it","-// renders. Resolving the CJS build directly skips the broken shim.","-//","-// The workspace has v30 hoisted (Jest 30 pulls it in) while React Native","-// asks for v29. `disableHierarchicalLookup` below stops Metro walking up","-// into `react-native/node_modules`, so v30 is what it finds.","-// Resolved via `package.json`, the only subpath the package's `exports`","-// map exposes besides the root; asking for `build/index.js` directly is","-// blocked by exports resolution.","-const prettyFormatCjs = path.join(","-  path.dirname(require.resolve('pretty-format/package.json', { paths: [workspaceRoot] })),","-  'build/index.js'","-);","-"," const config = getDefaultConfig(projectRoot);"," ","-config.watchFolders = [workspaceRoot];","+config.watchFolders = [workspaceRoot, ...storeWatchFolders(projectRoot)];"," ","-config.resolver.nodeModulesPaths = [","-  path.resolve(projectRoot, 'node_modules'),","-  path.resolve(workspaceRoot, 'node_modules'),","-];","-config.resolver.disableHierarchicalLookup = true;","-config.resolver.unstable_enableSymlinks = true;","-","-const baseResolveRequest = config.resolver.resolveRequest;","+const defaultResolveRequest = config.resolver.resolveRequest;","+const baseResolveRequest = pinSingletonsToApp({","+  libraryRoot: path.resolve(workspaceRoot, 'packages/styled-components'),","+  projectRoot,","+  resolveRequest: (context, moduleName, platform) =>","+    defaultResolveRequest","+      ? defaultResolveRequest(context, moduleName, platform)","+      : context.resolveRequest(context, moduleName, platform),","+});"," config.resolver.resolveRequest = (context, moduleName, platform) => {","   if (moduleName === 'styled-components' || moduleName === 'styled-components/native') {","     const filePath = platform === 'web' ? styledWebBridgeSource : styledNativeSource;","     return { type: 'sourceFile', filePath };","   }","-  if (moduleName === 'pretty-format') {","-    return { type: 'sourceFile', filePath: prettyFormatCjs };","-  }","-  return baseResolveRequest","-    ? baseResolveRequest(context, moduleName, platform)","-    : context.resolveRequest(context, moduleName, platform);","+  return baseResolveRequest(context, moduleName, platform);"," };"," "," module.exports = config;"],"additions":12,"deletions":36,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/sandbox/next.config.ts","lines":["@@ -1,9 +1,26 @@","+import { realpathSync } from 'node:fs';","+import { createRequire } from 'node:module';","+import { sep } from 'node:path';","+"," import type { NextConfig } from 'next';"," ","+const storeMarker = `${sep}links${sep}`;","+const realNextPath = realpathSync(createRequire(import.meta.url).resolve('next/package.json'));","+const storeMarkerAt = realNextPath.indexOf(storeMarker);","+"," const nextConfig: NextConfig = {","   compiler: {","     styledComponents: true,","   },","+  experimental: {","+    // Turbopack only compiles files under its root. With pnpm's global virtual","+    // store the installed packages live outside the repository, so the store is","+    // added as a root.","+    turbopackAdditionalRoots:","+      storeMarkerAt === -1","+        ? {}","+        : { pnpmStore: { path: realNextPath.slice(0, storeMarkerAt + storeMarker.length - 1) } },","+  },"," };"," "," export default nextConfig;"],"additions":17,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/sandbox/package.json","lines":["@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@","     \"@types/node\": \"^22.19.15\",","     \"@types/react\": \"^19.2.14\",","     \"@types/react-dom\": \"^19\",","-    \"next\": \"^16.2.6\",","+    \"next\": \"^16.4.0\",","     \"typescript\": \"^5.9.3\"","   },","   \"dependencies\": {"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path